{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "31", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "01", "M": "10", "S": "27"}}, "news": [{"title": "JK Lakshmi Cement to invest \u20b911,000 crore in 2.5 MTPA Assam plant", "para": "JK Lakshmi Cement has initiated the construction of an integrated cement plant in Umrangso, Assam, with a significant investment. This project, named Kamakshi, is expected to have a production capacity of 2.5 million tonnes per annum. The cement plant will feature a one million tonne clinkerisation unit and create over 2,000 jobs upon becoming operational. The company aims to complete the project by FY 2029, focusing on the Northeast market.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/cement/jk-lakshmi-cement-to-invest-11000-crore-in-2-5-mtpa-assam-plant/135368327?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-268550/135368327.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "cement"}, {"title": "The Phoenix Mills\u2019 net profit rises 11% to \u20b9424.05 crore in Q2 FY27", "para": "For the quarter ended September 30, 2026, Phoenix Mills achieved a 10.8 percent boost in net profit after tax. The total income saw a 3.7 percent increase compared to the previous fiscal year, coupled with a remarkable 25 percent year-on-year growth in retail consumption across its operations. Improvements in operating free cash flow and liquidity further highlight Phoenix Mills' strong financial standing in Q2 FY27.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/retail/the-phoenix-mills-net-profit-rises-11-to-424-05-crore-in-q2-fy27/135368083?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-50422/135368083.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "retail"}, {"title": "Lodha Developers\u2019 net profit rises 28% to \u20b91,013.5 crore in Q2 FY27", "para": "Lodha Developers reported a 28.3 percent rise in n